{
  "name": "romdev-platform-gba",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Game Boy Advance binaries for romdev: mGBA emulator core + arm-none-eabi-gcc toolchain (cc1 / as / ld / objcopy) (WASM). These ship together because nothing else uses them.",
